OL,3,GNEWSAChildhood 'taken from me' through
OL,4,Afake illnesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe has now participated in a Channel 4
OL,7,Fdocumentary, as has her son, his sister
OL,8,FLaura, doctors from Torbay and police
OL,9,Fwho investigated.
OL,11,FNow 25, Johnson said: "I do think that
OL,12,Fmy childhood was taken from me and
OL,13,Fthat's something that you can't go back
OL,14,Fto, so it is difficult to process."
